<title>USA: Metro Atlanta Rapid Transit $165 mln sale on 12/11.</title>
<headline>Metro Atlanta Rapid Transit $165 mln sale on 12/11.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metro Atlanta Rapid Transit plans a $165 million sales and tax revenue bond issue through competitive auction on December 11, the issuer's financial adviser said Tuesday.</p>
<p>Evensen-Dodge Inc, the adviser, said the sale would be at 1100 EST.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
